# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# This file exists primarily for one line: secrets/. Without an explicit
# .gcloudignore, gcloud synthesises one, and a service account key travelling
# into a build context is a credential leak that is very hard to notice after
# the fact. Being explicit here is worth more than being terse.

secrets/
*.key.json
key.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.gitignore

# Build output — the image builds from source inside Cloud Build.
bin/
*.exe
vendor/

# Local-only material.
testdata/out/
docs/checkpoints/
*.test
coverage.*
